Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第15集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:53.90,CMCT中文字幕,,0,0,0000,,(一周后)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.41,0:00:04.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸希望我们继承他的事业{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,救助他人 猎杀恶魔 家族事业{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saving people, hunting things, Family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.21,0:00:12.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这里有治疗宿罪的好药物{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a really good cure for a hangover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:15.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就是用烟灰缸装三明治给你吃{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a greasy pork sandwich served up in a dirty ashtray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:17.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 我恨你 我知道你会的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I hate you. - I know you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:19.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们别再玩那些无聊的游戏了 什么无聊的游戏？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not gonna start that. Start what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.43,0:00:22.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那些恶作剧 那很愚蠢而且没完没了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That prank stuff. It's stupid and it always escalates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:23.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 那又怎么样？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:25.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是害怕你的洗发水里又出现虫子吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afraid you're gonna get a little Nair in your shampoo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:27.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好 你记住 是你要开始的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just remember you started it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:31.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个 是我干的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the-? One: me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:34.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这就是你的水平啊？你太弱了 你这个变态{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's all you got? That's weak. - You're a frigging jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:36.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你闻起来象一只掉在马桶里的 小鸡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You smell like a toilet. - Chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:37.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,变态 贱人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jerk. - Bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:38.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 白痴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up. - Wuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:40.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,贱人 变态{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bitch. - Jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.71,0:00:46.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是你要继续的 长毛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, bring it on, baldy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.15,0:01:17.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,请问{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:20.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你走丢了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you lost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.28,0:01:22.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有 我一直在等你 教授{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I've been waiting for you, professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:27.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 哦 你是我教过的学生吗？- 你不记得我了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah, you're in one of my classes? - Don't you recognize me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.33,0:01:30.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我教的班级太多了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.67,0:01:33.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不管怎么说 我的办公时间是在 星期二和星期四的上午{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're big classes.Anyway, my office hours are Tuesday and Thursday mornings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:36.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是吗？我只是… 希望能见你一面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? I was hoping I could see you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:44.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那 既然你这么有诚意 进来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, since you asked so nicely, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.78,0:02:03.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这张照片真帅{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a handsome photo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:06.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是很久以前的事了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That old thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:09.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那 我能帮你点什么吗？期末论文写得怎么样了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what can I do for you? How's the Anscombe paper coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,教授 我…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, professor, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:17.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想跟您说句实话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a confession to make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:19.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦？说什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我并不是您的学生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not really one of your students.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.14,0:02:23.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.93,0:02:25.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那 你为什么要到这儿来？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:36.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我看我还是走吧 等等{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe I should just go. - Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.53,0:02:42.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我明白了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:47.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我了解你的感受 这是发自内心的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand how you're feeling and it's only natural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:52.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你很年轻又天真活泼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are young and wide-eyed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:57.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而我站在这里 在某种程度上也算是个名人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm somewhat of a celebrity around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:10.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别误会我 你真的很漂亮{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get me wrong, you're a very beautiful girl...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:16.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但我又不忍心占你的便宜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it would be wrong of me to take advantage of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:20.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只是 呃… 我只是太尊重你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just, uh... I just respect you too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:52.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:56.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:58.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不再喜欢我了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you like me anymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:09.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不再需要我了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you want me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:15.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伙计 你介不介意不在我床上吃那些东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, you mind not eating those on my bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:19.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 我不介意{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:29.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 调查的如何了？- 想知道进行的如何了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's the research going? - You know how it's going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.07,0:05:31.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,慢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.53,0:05:34.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,该死的你知道如何才能进行的更快吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how it would go a heck of a lot faster?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:37.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果我有电脑的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had my computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:49.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你能调小点声吗？拜托 - 好 当然可以{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you turn that down, please? - Yeah, absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:57.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:06:00.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许你应该去别的地方呆会{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should just go somewhere for a while, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:02.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 我很想去 这主意很不错…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'd love to. That's a great idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:06.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 不幸的是 我的车他奶奶的完蛋了 - 我告诉过你 这不关我的…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unfortunately, my car's screwed to hell. - I told you I had nothing to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:22.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 鲍比 嘿 - 小伙子们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Bobby. - Boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:24.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 鲍比{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Bobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.59,0:06:27.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这么快能再见到你们真好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to see you again so soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.30,0:06:29.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 呃… 谢谢你能赶来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, uh, thanks for coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:31.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,快进来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:35.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝你来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.47,0:06:39.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 呃… 你们在电话里想跟我谈什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what didn't you wanna talk to me on the phone about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:41.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是关于我们正在做的一些事情{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's this job we're working we{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:44.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们不敢确定你会相信我们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We weren't sure you'd believe us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我能相信很多东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I can believe a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:49.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是 是的 我知道 只是我们从来没有见过这样的事情{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, yeah, yeah. I know. It's just, we've never seen anything like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:50.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,连类似的都没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:52.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以我们认为可以利用一些其他人的经验{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought we could use some fresh eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:54.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为何你们不从开始讲起？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, why don't you begin at the beginning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:56.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没问题 好的 请坐{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Um, all right, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.95,0:06:58.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:00.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是从我们找到的一条讣告开始的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it all started when we caught wind of an obit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:04.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你瞧 一个教授脸朝下… 从四楼的窗户掉了下来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, a professor took a nosedive from a fourth-story window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.59,0:07:07.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,校园传说那是个闹鬼的房子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only there's a campus legend that the building's haunted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:10.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以 我们就假扮成当地报纸的记者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we pretexted as reporters from the local paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:17.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 我们都是教授课上的学生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both had the professor for Ethics and Morality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.85,0:07:19.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 为何你认为是他做的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? So why do you think he did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:24.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谁知道 他是有家室的 有妻子和孩子 他的书是个大手笔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows? He was tenured, wife and kids, his book was, like, a really big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:29.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,话说回来 是谁说他一定是自杀的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then again, who's to say it was suicide?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.19,0:07:31.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 珍 够了 - 那么… 还能是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jen, come on. - Well, what else could it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:34.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你应该知道关于克劳福德礼堂的事情吧 - 不 事实上我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, you know about Crawford Hall. - No. I don't, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:36.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那都是胡扯 那完全只是个当地的传说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bunch of crap, a total urban legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:39.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,希瑟的妈妈从前在这里上学… 而且她认识那个女孩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Well, Heather's mom went to school here and she knew the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:40.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等等 哪个女孩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:45.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,30年前 这个女孩和某个教授有私情{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like 30 years ago, this girl was having an affair with some professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:48.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他把她给甩了 她就跳楼自杀了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He broke it off. She jumped out the window and killed herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:51.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你知道她的名字吗？- 不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know her name? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.59,0:07:54.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是人们说她是从669号房间跳楼的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they say she jumped from Room 669.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:57.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,明白了吗？你把9倒过来看…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it? You turn the nine upside down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:02.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以 现在她在那座房子里面出没…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now she haunts the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:06.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果谁看到了她… 就没法活着再讲这个传说了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And anyone who sees her, they don't live to tell the tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.23,0:08:09.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果没有人能够活着讲出这个传说… 那么 这个传说是怎么来的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if no one lives to tell the tale, then how does the tale get told?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:10.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,柯蒂斯 闭嘴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curtis, shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:15.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,知道吗 非常感谢你们 失陪了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Uh, thanks a lot, guys. Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:38.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 你在… 你在喝什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, what are you...? What are you drinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:42.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道 伙计 我想这叫做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, man. I think they're called purple nurples. Ha, ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:44.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想我们应该去检查一下教授的办公室{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think maybe we should go check out the professor's office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:46.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦不 不 不行 我现在不行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no. I can't right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:49.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我现在已经钓上一只迷人的小野猫了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got some... I've got a feisty little wildcat on the hook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:51.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我已经准备好了… 嘿嘿… 让她爽爽{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm about to, zip, reel her in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:52.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我介绍给你认识 - 迪恩…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll introduce you. - Dean..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:55.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,斯塔拉 斯塔拉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starla. Starla, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:09:00.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是我航天飞机上的副驾驶员 汤姆少校 汤姆少校 这是斯塔拉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my shuttle copilot, Major Tom. Major Tom, Starla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:03.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他帅吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm, ha, ha. Enchanté.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:05.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:15.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起 我只是把酒给压下去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Just trying to keep my liquor down. Ha, ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:17.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,干的不错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Good job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:19.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 有个好消息{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:21.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她有一个妹妹{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's got a sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.35,0:09:29.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on a minute. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:32.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,拜托 伙计 事情不是这样的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, dude. That's not how it happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:35.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是吗？所以说你从来没有喝过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No? So you never drank a purple nurple?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:37.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个也许喝过 不过…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, maybe that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:40.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我从来不会说像"迷人的小野猫"一样的话 而且她的名字不是斯塔拉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't say things like "feisty little wildcat." Her name wasn't Starla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:42.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那名字是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:45.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道 不过她是一个优雅的女人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. But she was a classy chick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:48.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她是个读人类学和民俗文化的学的大学毕业生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was a grad student: Anthropology and Folklore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:50.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们想说的是关于那个当地的鬼传说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were talking about local ghost stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.09,0:09:59.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为了…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's to..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.51,0:10:01.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为了我们自己干杯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:10.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我的上帝啊 你太有魅力了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, you are attractive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:13.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢 但是现在没有时间说这些{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, but no time for that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:18.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你得跟我讲讲关于那个传说的事情{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to tell me about this urban legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.49,0:10:21.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,拜托了 时间不多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, lives are at stake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:25.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起 我只是… 无法集中精神{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I just...I can't even concentrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:28.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就像是只能愣着神…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like staring...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:31.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,盯着你 无法自拔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:47.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 你认为你在做着什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, what do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:54.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 拜托{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.77,0:10:57.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果你不介意的话 给我5分钟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wouldn't mind, just give me five minutes here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:10:59.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 这是一个很严肃的调查{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, this is a very serious investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:01.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们没有时间给你亲亲我我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have time for any of your blah-blah blah-blah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.95,0:11:02.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,亲亲我我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blah-blah blah-blah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.37,0:11:05.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,亲亲我我 亲亲我我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blah, blah blah blah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:08.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,亲亲我我 亲亲我我 亲亲我我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blah, blah-blah-blah blah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:11.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,亲亲我我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:13.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,够了 这个是真正发生的事情{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, and that's how it really happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:17.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我不会那样说话 迪恩 - 对我来说你会那样说话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't sound like that. - That's how you sound like to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:19.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 你们两个到底怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, what's going on with you two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:21.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没事 什么事都没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. It's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.97,0:11:24.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,快说 你们像对老夫妻一样吵吵闹闹{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Now, you're bickering like an old married couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.85,0:11:27.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不对 知道么 老夫妻是可以离婚的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. See, married couples can get divorced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:29.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我和他？我们就像… 呃… 畸形连着屁股的婴儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and him? We're like, uh, Siamese twins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:32.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是连体婴儿 - 看 明白我的意思了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's conjoined twins. - See what I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:34.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听着 这…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.11,0:11:38.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们只是被搞的焦头烂额 精疲力竭 仅此而已{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've just been on the road for too long. Tight quarters, all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:39.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不用担心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:40.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:44.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 我们继续 我们认为这可能是鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So anyway, we figured it might be a haunting...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以我们便去检查凶案现场{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we went to check out the scene of the crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.91,0:11:55.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你在这里工作多久了？我已经在这里擦了六年的楼梯了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So How long you been working here? I've been mopping for six years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:11:58.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们到了 伙计们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:02.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那东西是做什么用的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the heck's that for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:04.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是用来寻找墙里的电线{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just finding wires in the walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:07.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:09.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不知道你们为什么要给这个办公室配线{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not sure why you're wiring up this office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:11.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不会对教授有什么作用了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not gonna do the professor much good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:14.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 为什么那样说？- 他死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why's that? - He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:16.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:19.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他就从那个窗户掉了下去 就是那个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went out that window right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:21.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:24.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你那天晚上在工作吗？- 我找到的他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Were you working that night? - I'm the one who found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:26.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你看到事情经过了吗？没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see it happen? Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:29.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只看到他进来这里 而且… 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saw him come up here and, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:31.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well... - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:34.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他不是一个人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.29,0:12:38.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他和谁一起？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was he with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:40.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,行了 我只吃了一个 也许是两个…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. I ate one, maybe two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:42.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只是随口说说 行吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let me tell it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:44.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他和一个年轻的女人一起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was with a young lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我跟警察讲了那个女人 但是 我猜他们没有找到她{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told the cops about her, but, uh, I guess they never found her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:49.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你看到那个女人进来 对吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw this girl go in, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.01,0:12:52.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么你有看到她出去吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But did you ever see her come out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:54.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在你们提醒我了 没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that you mention it, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你从前见过她吗 在这周围？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever see her before around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:12:59.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 不是她 - 那是什么意思？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, not her. - What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:01.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不想去毁谤中伤一个去世的人 但是… 呃{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mean to cast aspersions on a dead guy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.57,0:13:04.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这里的"道德先生"…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, uh, Mr. Morality here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:06.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他带过许多女孩子上来过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He brought a lot of girls up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:08.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,比厕所里面的马桶还多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got more ass than a toilet seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.95,0:13:15.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,再多问一下 这个房子 只有四层 对吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more thing. Uh, this building, it only has four stories, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:19.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 所以这里不会有669号房间{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - So there wouldn't be a Room 669?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.29,0:13:20.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当然没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:21.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为什么这样问？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.09,0:13:23.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是好奇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, just curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:26.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 没什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:31.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有电动势反应 这点很确定{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no traces of EMF, that's for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.35,0:13:34.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而且关于那个669号房间 都是一派胡言{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that Room 669 is a load of crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:37.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 你怎么想的？教授只是跳楼自杀？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you think, the professor's just a jumper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 传说只是个传说？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Legend's just a legend? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:44.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看门人提到的那个女人 有点问题{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, the girl the janitor described, that's pretty weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:45.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:47.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们应该去查查那座房子的历史记录{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ought to check out the history of the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:51.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 看看有没有女孩子跳楼摔死在那儿 - 是的 没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See if any coed ganked herself there. - Yeah, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:59.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伙计 你用过我的电脑吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, were you on my computer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.75,0:14:03.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 哦 真的吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.21,0:14:07.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这里正定格在… 在… 在大波亚洲美女的网站上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it's frozen now on, uh, bustyasianbeauties.com.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:14.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.14,0:14:19.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你能不能… 不要再碰我的东西了 好吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you just... Don't touch my stuff anymore, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:22.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你为什么不去吃药控制好你的大脑强迫紊乱症？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you control your OCD?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:24.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们找到关于那座房子的什么事了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But did you dig up anything about the building?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:27.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,或者是跳楼自杀的女学生？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or on the suicidal coed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:30.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有 历史记录很干净{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. History's clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:33.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那么这不是闹鬼 - 也许不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then it's not a haunting. - Maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:35.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,跟你讲实话吧 我们也不是很确定{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To tell you the truth, we're not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:37.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你那是什么意思 你们不是很确定？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean you're not sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:40.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 这很奇怪 - 什么很奇怪？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, it's weird. - What's weird?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.75,0:14:45.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,下一个部分 我们 呃… 事实上 我们不是亲眼看到事情的发生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This next part, we, uh, didn't see it happen ourselves exactly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:48.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是… 即使对我们来说 这真的也太奇怪了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's pretty frigging weird, even for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:49.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 外星人？- 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aliens? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:51.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 外星人？- 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aliens? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:55.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听着 如果他们是真的存在 他们肯定会来到地球袭击人类{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if they are real, they're sure as hell not coming to Earth and swiping people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:57.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 相信我 我们知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, believe me. We know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:16:01.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,向上帝保证 我这辈子都没有找到… 关于外星人绑架的任何证据{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My whole life, I've never found evidence of an honest-to-God abduction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:02.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这都是些恶作剧和异想天开的想法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all just cranks and pranks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 我们当初也是这样认为的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's what we thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:08.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是… 我们认为至少可以和那家伙谈谈{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we figured we'd at least talk to the guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:16.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 你应该把那些"紫色奶头"全干了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you gotta give those purple nurples a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.47,0:16:22.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,发生什么了 柯蒂斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what happened, Curtis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:26.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们不会相信我 没有人相信{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't believe me. Nobody does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:28.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,给我们个机会{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:31.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不想我的话见报{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not want this in the papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:32.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么就删除记录{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off the record then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:41.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:44.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我喝多了 然后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I blacked out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:49.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我记不得有多久… 当我醒来的时候 我不知道我在哪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I lost time and when I woke up, I don't know where I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:56.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:17:00.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们对我做了实验{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did tests on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.93,0:17:03.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.86,0:17:11.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.53,0:17:15.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们给我做肠镜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They probed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.03,0:17:20.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们给你做肠镜？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They probed you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:25.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 他们给我做肠镜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they probed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.29,0:17:31.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一次 又一次 再一次的…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again and again, and again, and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:41.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,再一次的 再一次的 再一次的… 一次接一次的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And again and again, and again, and then one more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:43.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yikes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:48.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这还不是最惨的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No and that's not even the worst of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.31,0:17:50.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还能怎么惨？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could it get any worse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:52.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,外星人把你强暴了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some alien made you his bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:00.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:04.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们让我… 跟他们跳情舞{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made me slow dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.65,0:18:38.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们又开始胡说八道了 对吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are exaggerating again, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:39.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:42.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么那个小子就是个白痴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then this frat boy is just nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:45.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们还不这么确定{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not so sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:50.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我告诉你 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, Dean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:52.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是某种喷气飞机的引擎造成的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this was made by some kind of jet engine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.54,0:18:54.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是说某种茶杯形状的喷气飞机的引擎造成的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you mean some saucer-shaped jet engine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:55.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那还能是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what else could it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:18:57.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 见鬼了 - 我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.05,0:19:00.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 说真的 伙计 到底是什么？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, seriously, dude. What the hell? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.47,0:19:02.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 最开始是闹鬼 现在来这个？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, first the haunting, now this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.05,0:19:05.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,单从时间上来讲… 这一定有某种联系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The timing alone, there's gotta be a connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:08.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是说在愤怒的灵魂和精装打扮的外星人之间？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, between the angry spirit and the sexed-up E.T.?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.14,0:19:11.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么样的联系有可能？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What could the connection possibly be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.31,0:19:12.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我们又能做什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what could we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.73,0:19:14.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以我们只好继续找线索{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we just kept on digging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:17.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你和这个叫柯蒂斯的人… 你们住在同一个房子里面？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you and this guy Curtis, you're in the same house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:19.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你知道他发生了什么事了 对吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - You heard of what happened to him, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:22.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 他说是外星人 但是… 你明白的… 随便吧…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he says it was aliens, but, you know, whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:24.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听着 伙计 我…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:27.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道这一定会很难过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this all has to be so hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:31.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 呃… 并不是很难过 - 但是我想让你知道…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Um, not so much. - But I want you to know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:32.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我会帮助你的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:37.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你真是个坚强的男子汉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brave little soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:39.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我理解你的痛苦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I acknowledge your pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:44.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:51.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你应该被这个世界更加的关爱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too precious for this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:52.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我从来没有那样说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:55.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你经常讲那些娘娘腔的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're always saying pansy stuff like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:01.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:05.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 好的 呃… 谢谢 谢谢你的拥抱 - 没什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, uh, thanks. Thanks for the hug. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.45,0:20:08.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是 呃… 我没事 真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, uh, I'm okay. Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:11.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,告诉你实话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To tell you the truth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:14.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,无论柯蒂斯发生了什么 他都罪有应得{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whatever happened to Curtis, he had it coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.37,0:20:16.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 他是我们这儿的流氓大王{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why's that? - He's our pledge master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:20.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这个学期让我们尝尽了苦头 我们忍了很久了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put us through hell this semester. Man, he got off on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:22.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以 现在他知道我们的感觉了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now he knows how we feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:26.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没关系了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:30.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还是一点头绪都没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It still doesn't make a lick of sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:33.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是 至少有一点联系了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But hey, at least there's one connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:35.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在哪之间？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Between what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:37.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,受害者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.31,0:20:39.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,教授和流氓男孩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The professor and the frat guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:41.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们都是混蛋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha, they're both dicks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.19,0:20:42.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是联系？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a connection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:45.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你有任何好的解释 我倒想听听{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got anything better to go on, I'd love to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:49.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我的笔记本电脑呢？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's my laptop? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:53.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,想想看… 一个喜欢玩弄女人的教授得到一个死去的女人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, think about it. A philandering professor gets a dead girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:54.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,流氓大王被非礼调戏{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pledge master gets hazed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:57.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我放在这里来着 - 很显然你没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I left it in here. - Well, you obviously didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:21:01.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 这些惩罚 他们都很有戏剧性{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, these punishments, they're almost poetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:03.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,实际上 这更有讽刺性 但是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, it'd be more like a limerick, but still...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.47,0:21:06.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 闹够了 你藏在哪了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, hilarious, ha, ha. Where'd you hide it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:08.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你的电脑？- 是的 你藏在哪了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your computer? - Yeah. Where'd you hide it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:10.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我为什么要藏你的电脑？- 因为其他人不会{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why would I take your computer? - No one else could have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.76,0:21:13.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们都锁着门 不用清洁工收拾房间{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We keep the door locked. We never let any maids in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.77,0:21:15.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看起来你弄丢了 爱读书的好学生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look's like you lost it, Poindexter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:23.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伙计 你知道吗？我已经忍了你很久了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, you know something? I put up with a lot from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:25.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你在说什么？有我在身边是很开心的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I'm a joy to be around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:27.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是吗？你水池里面的臭袜子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Your dirty socks in the sink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.86,0:21:30.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你冰箱里的食物 - 我的食物怎么了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your food in the fridge. - What's wrong with my food?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:31.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那不再是食物了 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not food anymore, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.87,0:21:33.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 这是达尔文主义 - 我喜欢它{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's Darwinism. - I like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.45,0:21:37.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我对你的要求 只有一件事… 就是不要搞乱我的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I ask from you, the one thing, is that you don't mess with my stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:39.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说完了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.59,0:21:43.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果我搞搞小黑你会是什么感觉？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, how would you feel if I screwed with the Impala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.13,0:21:46.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那将会是你生前做过的最后一件事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd be the last thing you ever did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.93,0:21:50.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你动了他的电脑吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you take his computer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.22,0:21:51.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,像仆人一样的照顾他 我没有动{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serves him right, but no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:53.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是我弄丢的 因为我从来不弄丢东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I didn't lose it because I don't lose things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.89,0:21:55.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 那没错 因为他是个完美先生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's right, yeah, because he's Mr. Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:58.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 好了 为何你不告诉我接下来发生了什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay. Why don't you just tell me what happened next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:01.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有一个受害者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was one more victim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.27,0:22:03.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们也没有亲眼看到这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Now, we didn't see this one ourselves either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.90,0:22:07.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们是从证据中推断出来的 但是这个人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We kind of put it together from the evidence, but this guy, he was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.99,0:22:10.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他是个科学家{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a research scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:11.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,动物实验{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Animal testing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.83,0:22:15.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 没错 一个混蛋 符合标准{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you know, a dick. Which fits the pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.81,0:23:20.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,警察没有公布死因{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cops didn't release a cause of death...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:23.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为他们对死因一无所知{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because they had no clue what the cause was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.27,0:23:26.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以… 我们自己来查出来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we checked it out ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.87,0:23:37.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.17,0:23:49.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这一定很快{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ought to be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.51,0:23:56.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.18,0:23:57.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这真恶心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is just nasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.97,0:23:59.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.60,0:24:03.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,被分尸了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mutilated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.69,0:24:05.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在我看来好象什么东西饿了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks to me like something was hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.06,0:24:10.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 他们确定他身份了吗？- 是的 一个大学里的科学家{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They identify him yet? - Yeah, a research scientist at the college.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:12.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,顺便猜猜他的办公室在哪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess where his office was, by the way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.61,0:24:14.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,克劳福德礼堂 和那个教授一样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crawford Hall, same as the professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.57,0:24:16.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那也是流氓男孩经历遭遇的地方{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right where the frat boy had his close encounter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.78,0:24:19.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.54,0:24:21.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 把那个东西拿给我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, grab me the thing, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.00,0:24:28.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.34,0:24:33.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看到什么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.76,0:24:35.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看起来像个…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.64,0:24:37.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一片腹部鳞片{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A belly scale?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.76,0:24:40.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一片腹部鳞片？什么东西的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A belly scale? From what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.27,0:24:41.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.31,0:24:44.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,鳄鱼的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An alligator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.15,0:24:48.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,下水道中的鳄鱼 拜托{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An alligator in the sewer? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.90,0:24:51.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么了 迪恩 这是个有名的城市传说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Well, Dean, it's a classic urban legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.82,0:24:53.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一个小孩把一条小鳄鱼从马桶冲下去…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A kid flushes a baby gator down the toilet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.78,0:24:55.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后它在下水道里面长成巨大的鳄鱼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it grows huge in the tunnels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.70,0:24:58.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是还没有人找到过 那不是真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but no one's really ever found one. They're not real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:25:01.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,外星人的绑架也是 但是那小子的确发生了什么事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, neither is alien abduction but something chomped on this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.62,0:25:05.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 不会再比这个还奇怪的了 - 也许我们应该找个帮手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This couldn't get any weirder. - Maybe we should get some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.33,0:25:08.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我会给鲍比打个电话 也许他从前遇到过类似的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call Bobby. Maybe he's run into something like this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.42,0:25:09.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 我保证他遇到过 给你上一堂典型的猎鬼课{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure. Just your typical haunted-campus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.96,0:25:12.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,外星人绑架和下水道中的鳄鱼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}alien-abduction, alligator-in-a-sewer gig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.88,0:25:14.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 小菜一碟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.51,0:25:16.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们决定检查下水道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We decided to search the sewer anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.93,0:25:19.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以我们分头行动{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we split up, each taking one end of campus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.93,0:25:21.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,找到什么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.52,0:25:24.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊 只不过不是在下水道里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I found something. Just not in the sewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.95,0:25:43.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.80,0:25:57.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.14,0:26:03.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你认为这很有趣吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think this is funny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.14,0:26:05.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那要看是什么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It depends. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.10,0:26:08.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我的车 - 你的车怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heh, heh. The car. - What about the car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.52,0:26:11.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不能就这样把轮胎的气给放了 那会让钢圈坏掉的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't let the air out of the tires. You're gonna bend the rims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.94,0:26:14.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 等等 我根本没靠近过你的车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, wait a minute. I didn't go near your car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.44,0:26:17.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗？那我怎么会找到这个的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Huh. Then how'd I find this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.54,0:26:26.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 把钱还我 - 哦 不 不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, give me back my money. - Oh, no. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.83,0:26:29.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这就作为我的精神损失费吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider it reparations for, uh, emotional trauma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.29,0:26:33.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 真好笑 把它还给我 - 不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, very funny. Now give it back. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.84,0:26:36.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 我会抢的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, I have had it up to here with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.55,0:26:38.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是吗？那就放马过来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Right back at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:46.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 天啊 放开我 - 还给我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- God, get off me. - Give it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.89,0:26:50.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 我都听够了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I've heard enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.77,0:26:52.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,两个小时后你就来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You showed up about an hour after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.86,0:26:56.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我很惊讶 真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surprised at you two. I really am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.32,0:27:00.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 迪恩没有偷你的电脑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, first off, Dean did not steal your computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.49,0:27:02.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但我 嘘 嘘 嘘 嘘{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I-There's...Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.70,0:27:05.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 萨姆也没碰你的车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Dean, Sam did not touch your car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.91,0:27:06.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.12,0:27:10.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果你们还是为小事纠缠不清的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you two bothered to pull your heads out of your asses...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.21,0:27:11.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那你们就别干了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it all would've been pretty clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.29,0:27:14.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你们在查的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - What you're dealing with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:18.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.72,0:27:19.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么也没有 - 我也是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got nothing. - Me neither.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.09,0:27:21.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们也许碰到了一个骗子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a trickster on your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.93,0:27:24.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我就是这么想的 - 什么？你才不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what I thought. - What? No you didn't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.89,0:27:26.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我来告诉你们…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I gotta tell you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.97,0:27:29.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们两个才是最大的线索{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you guys were the biggest clue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.23,0:27:30.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.89,0:27:34.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这东西专搞恶作剧 就和呼吸一样简单{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These things create chaos and mischief as easy as breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.90,0:27:36.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就把你们搞糊涂了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's got you so turned around...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.03,0:27:39.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,让你们胡思乱想{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and at each other's throats, you can't even think straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.99,0:27:41.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 电脑 - 轮胎{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The laptop. - The tires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:43.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他知道你们找上他了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It knows you're onto him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.32,0:27:47.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还把你们玩弄于股掌之间{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's been playing you like fiddles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.24,0:27:50.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么它是什么 精神力量 魔鬼 还是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what is it? Spirit, demon, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.66,0:27:53.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是一种半人半神的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, more like demigods, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.67,0:27:55.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是 洛基 在斯堪的纳维亚半岛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's Loki in Scandinavia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.59,0:27:58.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,西非传说中的 安那西 成千上万{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's Anansi in West Africa. Dozens of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.09,0:28:02.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们是不死的 他们能凭空创造东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're immortal and they can create things out of thin air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.26,0:28:04.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,和你我一样真实 也能让这些消失的无影无踪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things as real as you and me. Make them vanish just as quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.14,0:28:08.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你说像恶魂 外星人 史前巨鳄{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, like an angry spirit or an alien, or an alligator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.60,0:28:10.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,受害者也符合它们的一贯标准{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The victims fit the m.o. too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.43,0:28:12.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,骗子们喜欢瞄准位高权重者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tricksters target the high and the mighty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.52,0:28:15.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,用一种近乎幽默的方式 把他们拉下谷地{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock them down a peg, usually with a sense of humor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.31,0:28:16.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,死亡恶作剧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deadly pranks, things like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.02,0:28:20.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,鲍比 这些东西看上去像什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bobby, what do these things look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.32,0:28:23.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,大部分都是人形{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots of things, but human mostly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.32,0:28:29.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在我们认识的人中 哪个人一直关心此事呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what human do we know who's been at ground zero this whole time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.21,0:28:41.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 这个不错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's a good one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.06,0:28:52.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.31,0:28:58.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我能吃吗？我能吃 来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you eat? I could eat. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.62,0:29:12.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我缺了点什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.96,0:29:18.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.35,0:29:39.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,抱歉 今天我很累 伙计们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry I'm dragging a little ass today, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.31,0:29:40.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,昨天晚上忙了一晚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had quite the night last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.32,0:29:44.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,"做"了一晚 如果你抓住我话的重点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots of sex, if you catch my drift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.65,0:29:47.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊 听着 我们不会久留的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, hard not to. Listen, we won't be long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.86,0:29:50.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就检查下三楼的几间办公室{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just need to check a couple offices up on three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.41,0:29:52.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.41,0:29:57.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,该死的 我把些东西忘在车里了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, damn. I forgot something in the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.37,0:29:59.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道是什么 我一会儿就来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? I'll catch up with you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.58,0:30:01.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.51,0:30:49.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就因为他读了几本世界周刊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just because he reads Weekly World News...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.51,0:30:51.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不能说明他就是我们要找的人 你也读过了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't mean he's our guy. You read it too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.47,0:30:53.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我告诉你 就是他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, it's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.43,0:30:55.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们还需要一些证据 就这些{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just think we need some hard proof. That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.14,0:30:59.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,鲍比还说过这些东西 有和昆虫一样的新陈代谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Bobby mentioned that these suckers have a metabolism like an insect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.44,0:31:00.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,洁白的牙齿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, a real sweet tooth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:03.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我没有发现任何糖果 甚至没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't find any candy bars or sugar. Not even Equal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.61,0:31:05.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 也许你还漏了什么 - 我从不漏东西的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You missed something. - I don't miss things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.53,0:31:07.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 对 你是"完美"先生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, right because you're Mr. Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.65,0:31:11.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？你别把这骗子对我们的把戏 把气撒到我头上来？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Are you still pissed at me because of what the trickster did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.78,0:31:15.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 算了吧 你在他出现之前就很跩了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, man. You been a tight ass long before that trickster showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.37,0:31:21.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你就待在这儿 盯住那个看门人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, just stay here. Keep an eye on the janitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.00,0:31:24.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我要去他的住处{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go to his place, see if I can find any evidence...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.46,0:31:27.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在你鲁莽的用木桩扎他之前 先找到些证据{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before you go barging in and staking the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.13,0:31:30.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等我回来 好吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wait till I get back, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.51,0:31:32.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 好吗？- 好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay? - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.47,0:32:11.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,见他的鬼去吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, screw this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.78,0:33:54.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们一直在等你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been waiting for you, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.95,0:33:59.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 你们是真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys aren't real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.62,0:34:02.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,相信我 那感觉也是真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, sugar, it's gonna feel real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.16,0:34:06.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧 让我们来给你按摩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let us give you a massage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.67,0:34:09.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wha...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.33,0:34:14.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我一直不适合完美的结局 真的 我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm a sucker for a happy ending. Really, I am...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.67,0:34:18.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是… 还是算了吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm gonna have to pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:21.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们是和平的礼物{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're a peace offering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.93,0:34:25.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道你们兄弟两在干什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you and your brother do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.56,0:34:30.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我以前也干过这事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been around a while, run into your kind before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.65,0:34:33.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那你知道我… 不能让你再去害别人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then you know that I can't let you just keep hurting people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.15,0:34:37.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.24,0:34:39.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这些人罪有应得{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those people got what was coming to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.07,0:34:41.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这些人作茧自缚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hoisted on their own petards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.58,0:34:48.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你和萨姆 我喜欢你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you and Sam, I like you. I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.75,0:34:52.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是真的 所以还是好好的享受吧…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So treat yourself, long as you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.17,0:34:56.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,多久都行 久到我去另外一个城市{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just long enough for me to move on to the next town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.51,0:35:02.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 我不能让你这么做 - 我本不想伤害你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I don't think I can let you do that. - I don't wanna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.85,0:35:05.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而你知道我会的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know that I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.39,0:35:09.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伙计 我要告诉你 我欣赏你的风格 我的意思是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, man, I gotta tell you, I dig your style. All right? I mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.19,0:35:15.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真的 我的意思是 和外星人慢舞{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do, I mean, phew. And the slow-dancing alien?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.36,0:35:20.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那是我的最爱 - 是啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One of my personal favorites. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.61,0:35:23.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 但我不能让你走 - 太令我失望了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I can't let you go. - Too bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.37,0:35:25.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我的确喜欢你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, I liked you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.54,0:35:28.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆是对的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.08,0:35:31.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不应该单独行动{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't have come alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.04,0:35:35.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那我同意你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'll agree with you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.18,0:35:48.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们在外面吵架 那是个陷阱？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That fight you guys had outside, that was a trick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.35,0:35:52.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.73,0:35:54.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不错啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.23,0:35:59.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你想见识真正的把戏？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you wanna see a real trick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.11,0:36:42.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,女士们 干的好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha! Nice toss, ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.45,0:36:45.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,表演得很好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.37,0:36:49.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.83,0:36:52.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 迪恩 迪恩 我真不想这么做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, Dean, Dean. I did not wanna have to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.08,0:36:58.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me neither.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.74,0:37:24.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们还好吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.49,0:37:26.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.24,0:37:29.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.62,0:37:31.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想说…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I gotta say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.29,0:37:33.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他真行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he had style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.38,0:37:42.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 鲍比 - 还是省省吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bobby, thanks a lot. We couldn't have. - Hey, save it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.92,0:37:45.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在有人发现他尸体前 我们快离开这里吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just get the hell out of Dodge before somebody finds that body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.80,0:37:47.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.39,0:37:50.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听着 迪恩…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Dean, um...{\r}
